<title>CHINA: Shanghai Cereals &amp; Oils Exchange to close on Wed.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Cereals &amp; Oils Exchange to close on Wed.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai Cereals &amp; Oils Exchange will close on Wednesday for the New Year holiday and trading will resume on Thursday, an exchange statement said.</p>
<p>Soybean contracts on the exchange closed up in the last session of 1996, with the key January 1997 contract rising 120 yuan to end at 3,230 yuan per tonne, traders said.</p>
</text>
